  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  How to add an Apple Photos shared album
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  1. In Photos, open the shared album → People tab → turn on "Public Website".
  2. Copy the public link (looks like https://www.icloud.com/sharedalbum/#B0...).
  3. Duplicate one <li class="album"> block below and paste the link into both
     the href and the visible label.

  This whole page is encrypted with StatiCrypt at build time, so the album
  links are only revealed to visitors who know the password.
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-->

